      "requirementId": "V8.2.4",
      "problems": [
        "condition no longer holds: no adaptive control reads time, location or device as an access input"
      ],
      "acknowledged": "Open drift, not an accepted state. The condition uses the pattern `geoip` to assert that no adaptive control reads location as an access input, and a product-analytics merge added `'$geoip_disable': true` - a line that turns geolocation off - which the substring matches. The decision is therefore rejected and V8.2.4 has left the matrix as NOT_ASSESSED although nothing about the application changed. It is recorded here so the rejection cannot appear or disappear again unseen; it is closed by replacing the pattern with usage-specific ones, which returns V8.2.4 to FAIL and clears this entry."
    }
